# PipelineStage and TelemetryJunction carry the nine named stages and five named
# observability fields, plus a caused_by link making a chain of junctions causally
# linked. Nothing in this workspace emits one -- no context-assembly pipeline of any
# kind exists to retrieve, filter, deduplicate, compress, or construct a request
# against a model.
